WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400
Values stay hidden as dots until you tap the eye, and a tap on the card copies them.

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:07.600
Add used to sit top right, out of thumb reach, so I moved it to the bottom.

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:10.500
Every row looked the same, so each item became its own card with its category by the title.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.867
The old app was light only, and now every screen comes in light and dark mode.
